{"id":"5d60e86f21ed502a","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-dirichlet-series.md","title":"Dirichlet Series","display":"df-dirichlet-series — Dirichlet Series","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-dirichlet-series","aliases":["58-df-dirichlet-series","Dirichlet Series","Zeta Function"],"display":"df-dirichlet-series — Dirichlet Series","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-dirichlet-series"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-dirichlet-series</span><span>Dirichlet Series</span><span>Zeta Function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dirichlet-series — Dirichlet Series"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirichletSeries}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{DirichletSeries}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s \\in \\mathbb{C}\">\\(s \\in \\mathbb{C}\\)</span> (complex variable)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=\\langle a_n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle\">\\(a=\\langle a_n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle\\)</span> (coefficient sequence)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_a\\subseteq\\mathbb C\">\\(D_a\\subseteq\\mathbb C\\)</span> (convergence domain)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathbb C^{D_a}\">\\(f\\in\\mathbb C^{D_a}\\)</span> (Dirichlet-series sum)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirichletSeries}_S(f,a,D_a)\">\\(\\mathrm{DirichletSeries}_S(f,a,D_a)\\)</span> (Dirichlet-series predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dirichlet\\text{-}series} \\vdash \\mathrm{DirichletSeries}_S(f,a,D_a)\\leftrightarrow a\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\land D_a=\\{s\\in\\mathbb C\\mid\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq m\\to|\\sum_{n=1}^{m}a(n)n^{-s}-\\ell|&lt;\\varepsilon)\\}\\land f\\in\\mathbb C^{D_a}\\land\\forall s\\in D_a\\;\\forall\\ell\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl(f(s)=\\ell\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq m\\to|\\sum_{n=1}^{m}a(n)n^{-s}-\\ell|&lt;\\varepsilon)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dirichlet\\text{-}series} \\vdash \\mathrm{DirichletSeries}_S(f,a,D_a)\\leftrightarrow a\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\land D_a=\\{s\\in\\mathbb C\\mid\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq m\\to|\\sum_{n=1}^{m}a(n)n^{-s}-\\ell|&lt;\\varepsilon)\\}\\land f\\in\\mathbb C^{D_a}\\land\\forall s\\in D_a\\;\\forall\\ell\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl(f(s)=\\ell\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq m\\to|\\sum_{n=1}^{m}a(n)n^{-s}-\\ell|&lt;\\varepsilon)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Zeta: most important Dirichlet series</li>\n<li>Euler product: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\zeta(s) = \\prod_p (1-p^{-s})^{-1}\">\\(\\zeta(s) = \\prod_p (1-p^{-s})^{-1}\\)</span></li>\n<li>Zeros: trivial at negative even integers</li>\n<li>The Riemann hypothesis conjectures <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Re}(s)=1/2\">\\(\\mathrm{Re}(s)=1/2\\)</span> for every nontrivial zero; it is not asserted here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Titchmarsh, The Theory of the Riemann Zeta-Function</li>\n<li>Iwaniec, Quantum Modular Forms</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirichletSeries}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"s \\in \\mathbb{C}","display":false},{"tex":"a=\\langle a_n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"D_a\\subseteq\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathbb C^{D_a}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirichletSeries}_S(f,a,D_a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dirichlet\\text{-}series} \\vdash \\mathrm{DirichletSeries}_S(f,a,D_a)\\leftrightarrow a\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\land D_a=\\{s\\in\\mathbb C\\mid\\exists\\ell\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq m\\to|\\sum_{n=1}^{m}a(n)n^{-s}-\\ell|<\\varepsilon)\\}\\land f\\in\\mathbb C^{D_a}\\land\\forall s\\in D_a\\;\\forall\\ell\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl(f(s)=\\ell\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq m\\to|\\sum_{n=1}^{m}a(n)n^{-s}-\\ell|<\\varepsilon)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\zeta(s) = \\prod_p (1-p^{-s})^{-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Re}(s)=1/2","display":false}],"bytes":1599,"backlinks":[{"id":"baa56d22ed548761","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DirichletSeries}_S$ (Dirichlet 级数和值域谓词, see [[../batch19/58-df-dirichlet-series.md]])"},{"id":"fb6604241f53b69a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c94c3cae0b898de5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bd554d3da5a43116","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},